                <pb facs="0146" n="38" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg38"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-06-09"><hi rendition="#italic">June 9, 1893</hi></date>.
                        (Received July 3.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 453.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Adverting to my dispatch, No. 446, of the
                    26th ultimo, I have to report that the House of Deputies, on yesterday, by a
                    vote of 93 to 52, refused to present articles of impeachment against
                    Vice-President Peixoto.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. H. Conger.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
